# Telos, Atris's academy again (TSL, 262TEL, to Citadel Station 221TEL):
# Kreia and Atris, the Darth Trayas past and present (kreatris); the
# Handmaiden (male Exile) before her sisters, refusing to fight them, the
# sisters fought, Atris's test of her (atrend1) and her fall to Atris's
# lightning; the Exile at the door asking Atris to punish him instead and
# to surrender (atrend2), Atris's flight to her meditation chamber; there,
# the offer of mercy refused by her, Atris fought and beaten, then spared:
# "I will not kill a helpless opponent", where the Sith strike from
# (Malachor V, Kreia gone there), "I will do nothing - except tell you that
# I am sorry"; the Handmaiden alive, her name given (handend, no alignment
# or influence: DSimpson), and MalMov02 and MalMov01b to Citadel Station.
# Starts from the academy's arrival:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_atris_again data/routes/tsl/finale_atris.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Telos - Hidden Base Again"; GameBanshee 24
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
# Left: nothing the scenes do not force.
#
# ASSUMES:
# - Male Exile (000_PLAYER_GENDER): the Handmaiden's scenes (sisend,
#   atrend1, atrend2, handend) play, not the female's Disciple ones.
# - The Handmaiden fights alone, the player's seat on her (a_sisend and
#   a_atrend1 use GetPartyLeader). # UNSURE: who leads (the party on
#   arriving from 006EBO, SwitchPlayerCharacter or a leader change); see
#   finale.md.
# - The sisters' fight: sisend's own note says it ends when they are all
#   killed or stunned; the headless fight kills them. # UNSURE: whether
#   killing them weighs on the alignment (no script on R18 says so).
# - Atris's fight with the Handmaiden ends scripted (atrend2's Force Wave,
#   the Handmaiden left dying); a_atrend2 then puts the Exile at
#   sp_pc_atrend2 and plays atrend2.
# - atrruncs: Atris runs to MedChamber; tr_atrend3 inside it starts
#   atrend3 start 0; she fights to a minimum of hit points, then start 1.
#   # UNSURE: atrend3's start 1 condition (c_dark) is the chamber darkened
#   after the fight, not the alignment.
# - a_hand_pc_end (atrend3's last reply) raises the Handmaiden and starts
#   handend; its end plays MalMov02, MalMov01b and starts 221TEL (no
#   waypoint: the entry, -57.4, -23.0, by Lieutenant Grenn).
talk                 # Kreia and Atris (kreatris)
say =I will not fight you. # sisend: the Handmaiden to her sisters
talk
fight 30             # the sisters
talk                 # atrend1: Atris and the Handmaiden
fight 30             # Atris and the Handmaiden: the scene ends it
say Do not harm her. If you wish to punish anyone, then punish me.
say Surrender, Atris. I don't want to fight you.
talk                 # atrend2: the Exile at the door
talk                 # atrruncs: Atris runs
to tr_atrend3        # her meditation chamber
say I will not fight you - surrender, and I will spare you.
talk                 # atrend3 start 0
fight 30             # Atris, to her minimum
say I will not kill a helpless opponent, Atris. # atrend3 start 1
say We have greater problems, Atris - and there has been enough killing.
say Can you tell me where the Sith are striking from? # Malachor V
say I have heard enough - this matter is finished.
say I will do nothing - except tell you that I am sorry.
talk
say It is good to hear your name. # handend
talk
module 221tel        # MalMov02, MalMov01b
save telos_citadel_siege
